---
const proofs = [
  { title: "Email, domains and setup", body: "Ideal for consultants and solo operators who need to look credible fast and stop leaking trust through messy tech." },
  { title: "Fixes that protect billable time", body: "The strongest buying trigger here is lost time. Position the service around getting people back to work quickly." },
  { title: "Simple websites for service businesses", body: "A clean, mobile-friendly site is often enough for a one-man band. Sell practical credibility, not digital theatre." },
];
---
<section class="wrap testimonials">
  <h2>Best-fit clients</h2>
  <p class="intro">The sweet spot is owner-led businesses where broken tech directly hits revenue, responsiveness or professionalism.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    {proofs.map(t => (
      <figure class="card">
        <div class="mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <blockquote>{t.body}</blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <strong>{t.title}</strong>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials h2{text-align:left}
  .intro{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
  .grid{
    display:grid;
    gap:20px;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
  }
  .card{
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:28px 26px 24px;
    margin:0;
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
  }
  .mark{
    position:absolute;
    top:6px;
    right:18px;
    font-family:Georgia,serif;
    font-size:64px;
    line-height:1;
    color:var(--gold);
    opacity:0.35;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  blockquote{
    margin:0 0 20px;
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--ink);
    font-size:15.5px;
    line-height:1.55;
    flex:1;
  }
  figcaption{
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--muted);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top:14px;
  }
  figcaption strong{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;font-style:normal}
  figcaption .muted{color:var(--muted);font-style:italic}
</style>
